@startuml
title SD-UI01 — Sign-in and account cart
caption To-Be draft | F01 · Frontend · Customer /login, /cart · merchant /merchant/login
actor User
boundary "Route and OtpForm and CartLines" as UI
participant "Shared API client" as Client
participant "Authorized API" as API
User -> UI : Open view or submit action
UI -> Client : challenge, verify, session, cart
Client -> API : Fetch or submit with applicable guards
alt Success
 API --> Client : Current typed result
 Client --> UI : Render or refresh authoritative data
else expired OTP, new-device sign-in or stale cart
 API --> Client : Typed failure
 Client --> UI : Show verification feedback or refetch canonical cart
end
@enduml
